  "notable_quotes": [
    "The tritopic linker in MAC-20 is designed to convert hinge motion along the z axis into pore-shape change on the xy plane.",
    "MAC-20, formulated as (H3O)2[Zn3(dmtrz)2(tipa)2]·4H2O, is a (3,4,6)-connected MOF built from 1D hinge-like zig-zag chains and a tritopic ligand.",
    "Earlier multi-step flexible MOFs such as HMOF-1, [Zn(L)2(OH)2], and MCF-82 do not show significant pore-shape change due to weak motion correlation."
